0008: ## Conventions (non-negotiable)
0009: - Grid shape: `grid.shape == (H, W)` meaning `(rows, cols)`.
0010: - Indexing: always `grid[r, c]`.
0011: - Coords: always `(r, c)`.
0012: - BBox: `(r0, c0, r1, c1)` inclusive.
